      ":question/id": "0a32180b-e7ab-50fa-bd5c-f4d095f92869",
      ":question/problem": "The row echelon form matrix $P$ is given below. What are its **non**-pivot columns?\n\n$$\nP=\\begin{bmatrix}0 & 5 & 8 & -2 & -7 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 2 & -7 & 5 \\\\ 0 & 0 & 0 & 2 & -2\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nSelect all that apply.",
